# block-app headless as `:dev` runs it, driven by the same commands as `drive`
# and painted with every plugin's own paint (guides/testing_a_gui.md, Testing
# editors together). The app is built for a worker, so the tests run on Linux
# x86_64 only. Each test is an action of its own under ./scripts/verify
# (run_apart in buck/cargo/defs.bzl), against an app that stages only the
# editors it names here beside the ones every app needs (apps.bzl), so it
# builds and reruns only for those. A test not named here stages every editor:
# keep it so for a test whose paintings show every block type, such as the add
# menu's.
